{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791694643,"nonce":"aSK7XlP7ayg6MQc5q7u3LE70pEY=","message":"Decision: preflight FAILs when the quadlet generator does not apply \u003cunit\u003e.container.d drop-ins (verified behaviourally: each planned secret must appear as --secret in its generated unit), naming the quadlet version and podman 5.0 as the minimum. Reason: CI's quadlet 4.9 generated the base units and silently ignored the drop-ins, so the units would run without secrets; spec 018 targets Fedora atomic with podman 5. 5.0 is the floor stated from evidence (4.9 fails, 5.8.4 works), not from a changelog check. Tests probe the installed generator and skip the drop-in dependent tests with the reason.","files":null}]}